WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.326
Standardization changes the numerical representation
used by software It

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:11.859
does not change the conceptual measurement scale
Temperature remains

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:18.070
an interval measurement Emergency visits remains a
count In

00:00:18.096 --> 00:00:22.346
a real predictive workflow fit the scaler on
training data only and then apply the

00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:27.973
fitted scaler to validation and test data That
preserves the train-test

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.670
boundary and avoids leakage
